Z||000000||Dumba$$||10-02-2001||04:11 PM||||what diff. wlii i notice with the polly ones vs. the stock ones? the rubber ones i have still look to be in verry good condition<P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>4.9 caddy engine for sale 30,000 miles complete with bubba joes mounts!!  $850<P>if it dont go, put a fart can, and clear taillights on it!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||10-02-2001||07:18 PM||||They will squeek! Mainly the cradle bushings.<P>I've run both and I can't say there is any major difference. The rubber gets sloppy with wear and the poly gets loose with wear (bang, bang, bang...)||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||10-02-2001||08:38 PM||||What do cradle bushings have to do with a sway bar?  I installed poly bushings and endlinks on the Grape Ape and never had any problems with it squeaking although poly is known for that.  If you do this (I'd strongly suggest it), I'd check out Prothane.  The are the poly endlink supplier to the Fiero Store and are cheaper.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||10-02-2001||08:51 PM||||since polly has less give than rubber, it has the result of giving you a stiffer bar. This can be good or bad depending on how you use the car and what other suspension alterations you have or may do.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Captain Midnight||10-03-2001||02:19 AM||||I may a set for sale, what size is your bar?<P>------------------<BR>Captain Midnight||||reg||1
Z||000005||lowCG||10-05-2001||12:58 AM||||The poly bar bushings will act like a step up in bar size,the endlinks will make your car feel like a dump truck,as these can bind up the movement unless they're sanded/ground into a ball like shape,ie.not flat like nearly all the poly endlinks are.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Monkeyman||10-05-2001||03:57 AM||||The Grape Ape rode pretty well and I didn't do anything to the end links.||||reg||1
